osts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T11:10:50-07:00","id":1238631,"title":"","content":"Never run/played Changeling. I'm familiar with WoD, but I have run pathfinder and Exalted for 13 years. Currently running Scion 2e. I've got a short term opening Saturday evenings PST, and I wouldn't mind something new. If you're willing to put up with someone new, I'd give it a go as an ST.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24418-dracheau","name":"Dracheau","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T11:23:19-07:00","id":1238635,"title":"","content":"I can't really do Saturday evenings, and was sort of leaning more toward PBP myself---it's slower, but at least it doesn't involve the theoretical mathematics required to get schedules to align across timezones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T12:01:37-07:00","id":1238645,"title":"","content":"Do you guys want to do it through tavern keeper?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"