\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If game will be Play By Forum - mark me interested. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> What is 'tavern keeper'?</div> </div> </div> </div>A play by post website with a dice roller embedded in","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T12:26:10-07:00","id":1238655,"title":"","content":"I can't exactly say I love the site so far, given the lack of anything resembling an FAQ and the dice roller's fairly scant options (no success counter, for one).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T12:44:56-07:00","id":1238663,"title":"","content":"Going over my previous good play in the PBF on this forum - we can use our <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1153531-occ-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls?p=1155294#post1155294\">previous Hunter game settings</a>. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caladriu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1153531-occ-hunter-the-vigil-2e-playtest-the-lucifuge-s-doubting-souls?p=1155294#post1155294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Check out some of the other PbP threads for an example. Usually what you do is write a paragraph or so just narrating what your PC does, how they respond to any conversations, etc. Same way you would talk in conversation at the game table. If you want to roll something, many people use Orokos: <a href=\"http://orokos.com/roll\" target=\"_blank\">http://orokos.com/roll</a> and link to the result of the roll. Usually the ST posts once, then all the players respond once, then the ST posts again. If it's a conversation between two PCs or something, you might post more often.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T19:46:29-07:00","id":1238758,"title":"","content":"I would be interested in being a player. I have had a idea for a combat focus summer beast for awhile. It would the first time i played PBP so i do not have a opinion about site or service used. It would be the first time i play pen and paper rpg so if you are willing to have someone new i would like to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22963-jtcweb","name":"jtcweb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T21:10:28-07:00","id":1238779,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m cool with play by post. Typical for me is Rpol.net they have a dice roller configured for Chronicles games.<br /> <br /> But I\u2019m fine with here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T01:00:55-07:00","id":1238817,"title":"","content":"I can't join if it's PbP, they tend to be too slow for me. I recommend Discord though, good place for PbPs, you can set up a server and add dice bot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24231-gamora","name":"gamora","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T11:09:27-07:00","id":1242983,"title":"","content":"Late post, but I\u2019m hoping to find a Changeling game myself at some point. I have a few characters I\u2019d love to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://